# Keys and secrets must never be uploaded with a deploy. They belong in Vercel's encrypted
# environment variables (`npx vercel env add GEMINI_API_KEY production`), not in the upload.
# (A .vercelignore replaces .gitignore for `vercel deploy`, so the usual entries are repeated.)
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

node_modules/
build/
dist/
coverage/
.DS_Store
*.log
.antigravity/
.aistudio/
.claude/settings.local.json
